Common CohortYear
    documentation "The type and year of a cohort (e.g., 9th grade) the student belongs to."
    enumeration SchoolYear
        documentation "The school year associated with the cohort; for example, the intended school year of graduation."
        is part of identity
    descriptor CohortYearType
        documentation "The type of cohort year (9th grade, graduation)."
        is part of identity
    descriptor Term
        documentation "The term associated with the cohort year; for example, the intended term of graduation."
        is optional
